            {
                "entry_id": "374b32ea-6f44-33ef-80d8-30a12498342d",
                "word": "ESG",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7cde112c-5d05-338a-8f7c-4dcee66532a5",
                        "entry_id": "374b32ea-6f44-33ef-80d8-30a12498342d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à des aspects environnementaux, sociaux et de gouvernance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cea2d0a1-85c9-41ac-b7ab-4981e83ab540",
                                "sense_id": "7cde112c-5d05-338a-8f7c-4dcee66532a5",
                                "text": "Parmi les critères ESG privilégiés, celui concernant l'environnement arrive en tête, avec des thématiques telles que le changement climatique, l'eau, la réduction des déchets plastiques ou l'économie circulaire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4bd8c57c-6c8f-4130-b199-e9443f89655c",
                                "sense_id": "7cde112c-5d05-338a-8f7c-4dcee66532a5",
                                "text": "Elle investit dans de nombreuses entreprises et vote selon plusieurs critères ESG : environnementaux, sociaux et de bonne gouvernance."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "99dbd6ee-b6ea-4c90-9422-03431dc5dbb1",
                        "source_entry_id": "374b32ea-6f44-33ef-80d8-30a12498342d",
                        "source_sense_id": "7cde112c-5d05-338a-8f7c-4dcee66532a5",
                        "target_lang_word": "ESG",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ESG",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c4fa44a-b089-3116-8f70-051034fcb000",
                                        "entry_id": "b98a739d-6dd0-3376-9eba-3bc674fbc31b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of environmental/ethical, social and corporate governance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "initialism",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "080c6432-d647-492d-9a91-2b117b414678",
                                                "sense_id": "7c4fa44a-b089-3116-8f70-051034fcb000",
                                                "text": "Advisers are encouraged to engage with their clients on ESG issues rather than merely regard ESG matters as a discrete checkbox compliance requirement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "915f03b9-f636-4208-8ee1-3eb18967224a",
                                                "sense_id": "7c4fa44a-b089-3116-8f70-051034fcb000",
                                                "text": "New firms like Arabesque are making ESG data a core part of their strategy. Goldman Sachs has filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission to start an ESG-focused exchange-traded fund."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b100ff17-4674-47a2-9726-e06c1cee708d",
                                                "sense_id": "7c4fa44a-b089-3116-8f70-051034fcb000",
                                                "text": "ESG funds"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8b4a8d6-147f-4d8f-9aeb-f1f74a52bb85",
                                                "sense_id": "7c4fa44a-b089-3116-8f70-051034fcb000",
                                                "text": "Much of this year’s letter was devoted to Mr. Fink’s belief that a focus on environmental, social and corporate governance issues — E.S.G., for short — does not conflict with making money."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ec13daf-8e33-435b-a831-2c9fc9f34bd5",
                                                "sense_id": "7c4fa44a-b089-3116-8f70-051034fcb000",
                                                "text": "In a shift in tone from his previously more strident embrace of ESG, Fink emphasised that clients were responsible for their own investment decisions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1269ffbf-5b48-3fd7-b618-aed5ab1a3e1d",
                                        "entry_id": "b98a739d-6dd0-3376-9eba-3bc674fbc31b",
